<h3><u>Aye musafir</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Alwida, alwida, alwida..(4)</p>

<p>Aye musafir, be kafan tu, khaak par wa hasrata<br />
Mai musafir shaam ki hu, dushmano mein berida<br />
Alwida, alwida, alwida..(2)<br />
Ae musafir..</p>

<p>1. Boli zainab, ae mere maa jaye ye kya haal hai<br />
kaise pehchanu tera laasha bohot pamaal hai<br />
aah re anta akhi kya, hai tu hi bhaiyya mera<br />
mai musafir shaam ki hu,.....</p>

<p>2. Kya tumhi ho ibne zehra, kya tumhi ibne ali<br />
kya tumhi bhai hasan ke, aur jaane zainabi<br />
ae gule baagh e mohammad, haal ye kya hogaya<br />
mai musafir shaam ki hu,.....</p>

<p>3. Na rahi nalayn, na malboos, na dastaaar hai<br />
ae ghareeb e fatima, tu khuld ka sardaar hai<br />
ae tane uryaa&#39;n tera to, aaj sab kuch lut gaya<br />
mai musafir shaam ki hu,.....</p>

<p>4. Mai rasan basta chali, waada nibhane ke liye<br />
ghar me qatil ke teri, masnad bichane ke liye<br />
kal yahi masnad banadungi, teri farshe azaa<br />
mai musafir shaam ki hu,.....</p>

<p>5. Bhai, amma, aur nana ka, padar ka waasta<br />
baat kar mujh se baradar, kholde aankhein zara<br />
dekh to chehra behan ka, kis qadar murjha gaya<br />
mai musafir shaam ki hu,.....</p>

<p>6. Laasha e besar tadapkar ye sada dene laga<br />
ae behan waada nibhake, mai to maqtal se chala<br />
thi sadaa rehan o sarwar, haaye khwahar alwida<br />
Mai musafir shaam ki hu, dushmano mein berida</p>

<p>Aye musafir, be kafan tu, khaak par wa hasrata<br />
Mai musafir shaam ki hu, dushmano mein berida<br />
Alwida, alwida, alwida..(4)</p>
</p>